   "body": "The razor too is personified — it \"regrets\" (<em>paenitebat</em>) its <em>sacrilegum acumen</em>, its profane sharpness, as if ashamed to be raised against a god. Both lamp and blade recoil from the deed.",
   "exam": "<strong>In an exam:</strong> \"The personified razor that <em>paenitebat</em> its <em>sacrilegum acumen</em> turns the murder weapon into a reluctant, guilty thing; calling its edge ‘profane’ frames the attempt as sacrilege against a god.\"",
